From fb1c1208e6bc822c33902cb2c31d05c04c83fab3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 11:49:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(brand): new Trabis logo and app icon

Replace the infinity logo with the new compartment mark (hidden T) in
trabis.html and buchhalter.html; favicon is now an SVG app icon and the
apple-touch-icon a 180px PNG. index.html (legacy) stays untouched.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WrSmbPeJ9qpSAgv9M15c7v
---
 buchhalter.html             |   6 +++---
 trabis-apple-touch-icon.png | Bin 0 -> 2518 bytes
 trabis-icon.svg             |   1 +
 trabis-mark.svg             |   1 +
 trabis.html                 |  10 +++++-----
 5 files changed, 10 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 trabis-apple-touch-icon.png
 create mode 100644 trabis-icon.svg
